        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant
Emissions, materials use, infrastructure, etc. for oil input to power plants;
UUID: 639c4bc0-8fb7-3ddb-9e13-2204de0af45d
All energy use, use of chemicals, emissions to air and water including treatment of flue gasses and effluents.
Location: Estimation for the country.
Technology: Estimation for average technology.
Time period: Emission factors provided by an authority for 2000, other data for Europe.
Production volume: 0.03 TWh from power plants and 2.9 TWh from combined cycle plants.
Sampling: Literature and statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_639c4bc0-8fb7-3ddb-9e13-2204de0af45d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
